**Acacia** (Heroic). A witch of the Order of Chaos whose real loyalty
is to her partner, Saspar. Acacia serves the Order of Chaos, a group
bent on reviving ancient magic to usher in an age of discord.
Alongside her partner Saspar she carries out whatever the Order asks,
armed with witchcraft and a retinue of demons. The Order's goals mean
little to her, though: she's devoted to Saspar, and serves Chaos only
because he does, hoping one day to be more to him than a partner.
*Agile +1, Attack (Black Magic) +2, Barrier +2 [Perks: Effective; 5
Endurance], Beautiful +3, Flight +3, Incorporeal Form +2, Knowledge
(Magic) +2, Magic, Witchcraft +3, Vigorous +2; Arrogant −1, Focus
(Flight/Incorporeal Form Require Hat) −2, Impulsive −1, Love Interest
(Saspar) −2, Overconfident −2, Servitude (Chaos) −3, Vulnerability
(Light/Holy) −2.* Lock Heaven's Door (Fatiguing, Unique Perk: Prevents
Healing/Recovering Until Battle's End): Roll 3, DX 3, End 10. A stroke
of her finger saps the target's energy and fills them with dread.
Devil's Breath (Affinity: Dark; Blinding; Feather Blow): Roll 3, DX 3,
End 15. A chilling breath clouds the target's mind. Defense 4. Health
40, Endurance 60. TV 14.

**Magic, Witchcraft.** Spells: Break (Frail −2; 10 Endurance), Impede
(Slow −2; 10 Endurance), Wither (Weak −3; 20 Endurance).

**Sazza and Fraz**, twin lesser demons of mischief in Acacia's
service, always appear together. Alone, each is feeble; as a pair they
hit startlingly hard. Secondary NPC. *Attack +2 [Perks: Effective x3,
Ranged; Flaws: Assisted], Quick +3; Frail −1, Weak −2.*

**High Fructo Cezar**, another of Acacia's demons, once held real
power, until a single act of kindness cost him his rank and sealed
away most of his strength. He resents it, but he stays mostly loyal to
Acacia. Secondary NPC. *Strong +3, Tough +2; Clumsy −1, Slow −2.*

